(5242047, 762044, 95579, '<td valign="top">Weird. Bit more contrast in the icicles so you can see them better would be nice but have no idea if you could have got more contrast in there.<br/>Really interesting shot</td>', 'Weird. Bit more contrast in the icicles so you can see them better would be nice but have no idea if you could have got more contrast in there.Really interesting shot', '2009-02-06 05:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
