(5242055, 761490, 95579, '<td valign="top">Great shot, not just cos its a cute fuzzy! Love the softness and the contrast from the grey to that little pink nose.  He really looks cosy.<br/>And im very curious about what it is..</td>', 'Great shot, not just cos its a cute fuzzy! Love the softness and the contrast from the grey to that little pink nose.  He really looks cosy.And im very curious about what it is..', '2009-02-06 05:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5242076, 762016, 101730, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed by the mic stands, I like the sense of movement in the person and the line of her (?) back and legs, but would''ve maybe preffered a little more definition, especially because the drums and speakers to the right and left are quite sharp in comparison. But then, I''m not sure how you''d do that with all the smoke. The greyness fits the dark rock feel that I imagine they''re playing.</td>', 'Nicely framed by the mic stands, I like the sense of movement in the person and the line of her (?) back and legs, but would''ve maybe preffered a little more definition, especially because the drums and speakers to the right and left are quite sharp in comparison. But then, I''m not sure how you''d do that with all the smoke. The greyness fits the dark rock feel that I imagine they''re playing.', '2009-02-06 06:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5242077, 761845, 101730, '<td valign="top">Impressive stormclouds... <br/> <br/>Oh, wait, there''s a helicopter there, too! <br/> <br/>Good double take. Would''ve preffered the heli to be slightly bigger cos it''s so small it''s hard to miss now, but that''s one of those things you don''t have much to say about in photography, eh.</td>', 'Impressive stormclouds...  Oh, wait, there''s a helicopter there, too!  Good double take. Would''ve preffered the heli to be slightly bigger cos it''s so small it''s hard to miss now, but that''s one of those things you don''t have much to say about in photography, eh.', '2009-02-06 06:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5242079, 761325, 101730, '<td valign="top">Someone went to the carwash for this picture... ;-) I like this picture, but not sure I can quite explain why. The industrial feel, the yellow/orange details on the car, ground and pillar, the way different parts of the picture are lit up that keep the picture interesting and the eye wandering. Oh, and it''s a nice car, too.</td>', 'Someone went to the carwash for this picture... ;-) I like this picture, but not sure I can quite explain why. The industrial feel, the yellow/orange details on the car, ground and pillar, the way different parts of the picture are lit up that keep the picture interesting and the eye wandering. Oh, and it''s a nice car, too.', '2009-02-06 06:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
