(5243939, 761867, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Looks like you sprayed these, looks quite effective, but, in my opinion, the most interesting parts of the image are the shapes and contours of the petals that are in focus and they don''t dominate enough of the frame.  Maybe not quite so close and or a variation in angle may have given this a little extra.</td>', '4 - Looks like you sprayed these, looks quite effective, but, in my opinion, the most interesting parts of the image are the shapes and contours of the petals that are in focus and they don''t dominate enough of the frame.  Maybe not quite so close and or a variation in angle may have given this a little extra.', '2009-02-07 16:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243942, 761196, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Good capture.  That''s quite a gift.  The recipient even looks taken aback by the generosity.  ''If only'' a little sharper and, wonder about a variation in crop, not just for this Challenge (to allow the grey to dominate more), but also to allow this to pack more punch (eg: maybe a little more off the bottom, who knows).</td>', '5 - Good capture.  That''s quite a gift.  The recipient even looks taken aback by the generosity.  ''If only'' a little sharper and, wonder about a variation in crop, not just for this Challenge (to allow the grey to dominate more), but also to allow this to pack more punch (eg: maybe a little more off the bottom, who knows).', '2009-02-07 16:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243966, 761780, 39850, '<td valign="top">1 - Unusual image, much tighter crop to see the detail in the drops .. or the glass.. whatever it is, make a unique image.  Alas I am looking for ''color grey''.</td>', '1 - Unusual image, much tighter crop to see the detail in the drops .. or the glass.. whatever it is, make a unique image.  Alas I am looking for ''color grey''.', '2009-02-07 17:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
