(5246381, 759871, 30982, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to get a really good skyline/landscape in tones of gray and you did an EXCELLENT job with this - your work with it paid off nicely, I think.  Suits this challenge very well.  Congrats on the 5th place star thingie!</td>', 'It''s hard to get a really good skyline/landscape in tones of gray and you did an EXCELLENT job with this - your work with it paid off nicely, I think.  Suits this challenge very well.  Congrats on the 5th place star thingie!', '2009-02-09 06:31:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246409, 762020, 89723, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bear_Music:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sempermarine:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m actually disappointed with the score. Oh well.<br/> <br/>If you gave me a 3,2, or 1 I''d be very interested in knowing why and how I can improve in your eyes. Thanks </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I didn''t vote this challenge, but to answer your question: Image is seriously oversharpened (see the halo around the bulb?): it looks like this may have been the best of your many attempts but it wasn''t as sharp as you''d have liked it, so you gave it a heavy dosing of USM. <br/> <br/>Another thing would be backlash against liquid-drop shots, which I believe we''re starting to see. To score really well, it seems to me, they need a sense of luminosity which this one, unfortunately, is lacking.<br/> <br/>Finally, this may just be me, but the border here is doing you no favors at all, it''s sort of clumsy/chunky. If the inline were only 1 pixel, that would help a lot. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Bear,<br/> <br/>Thanks for the comments. I appreciate you taking the time. I know you didn''t vote, but if you did and gave me a 1, 2, or 3 I could live with it based on your comments. Now back to the drawing board.</td>', 'Originally posted by Bear_Music: Originally posted by sempermarine: I''m actually disappointed with the score. Oh well. If you gave me a 3,2, or 1 I''d be very interested in knowing why and how I can improve in your eyes. Thanks   I didn''t vote this challenge, but to answer your question: Image is seriously oversharpened (see the halo around the bulb?): it looks like this may have been the best of your many attempts but it wasn''t as sharp as you''d have liked it, so you gave it a heavy dosing of USM.  Another thing would be backlash against liquid-drop shots, which I believe we''re starting to see. To score really well, it seems to me, they need a sense of luminosity which this one, unfortunately, is lacking. Finally, this may just be me, but the border here is doing you no favors at all, it''s sort of clumsy/chunky. If the inline were only 1 pixel, that would help a lot.   Bear, Thanks for the comments. I appreciate you taking the time. I know you didn''t vote, but if you did and gave me a 1, 2, or 3 I could live with it based on your comments. Now back to the drawing board.', '2009-02-09 07:17:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246413, 760880, 60614, '<td valign="top">Congratulations.  The thumbnail didn''t look like something you would shoot but as soon as I opened and saw the web then I knew.  Well done on an awesome photo.</td>', 'Congratulations.  The thumbnail didn''t look like something you would shoot but as soon as I opened and saw the web then I knew.  Well done on an awesome photo.', '2009-02-09 07:21:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246426, 761928, 43410, '<td valign="top">we have a new heavy hitter on our hands...this is amazing, great shot and welcome to DPC :D</td>', 'we have a new heavy hitter on our hands...this is amazing, great shot and welcome to DPC :D', '2009-02-09 07:39:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246437, 761904, 34462, '<td valign="top">Cool pic.</td>', 'Cool pic.', '2009-02-09 07:51:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246443, 761947, 67697, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8 and expected it to finish much higher.  I thought this was a beautiful and sentimental photo.</td>', 'I gave this an 8 and expected it to finish much higher.  I thought this was a beautiful and sentimental photo.', '2009-02-09 08:00:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246444, 761928, 35409, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by dRock:</b></div><hr/><i> Camera: Nikon D200<br/>and you said a d700....<br/>which one is it? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It was definitely taken with the D700. Sorry - I did not realize I still had the D200 set as default in my info. I corrected it.<br/> <br/>Thanks so much to everyone for all the nice comments, great to wake up to this!</td>', 'Originally posted by dRock: Camera: Nikon D200and you said a d700....which one is it?   It was definitely taken with the D700. Sorry - I did not realize I still had the D200 set as default in my info. I corrected it. Thanks so much to everyone for all the nice comments, great to wake up to this!', '2009-02-09 08:02:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246451, 761881, 35357, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an amazing scene!  I love it!  Including the sun in the shot is something I love as well.  Some dirty burnt look in the cloud around the sun unbalances it.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-02-09 08:13:11.</i></td>', 'Wow, what an amazing scene!  I love it!  Including the sun in the shot is something I love as well.  Some dirty burnt look in the cloud around the sun unbalances it.', '2009-02-09 08:11:17.000000', '2009-02-09 08:13:11.000000', 0),
(5246454, 761976, 55005, '<td valign="top">Erik, congrats on top 10!</td>', 'Erik, congrats on top 10!', '2009-02-09 08:14:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246455, 762027, 67697, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.  The bubbles give it an extra kick.  I gave it an 8 and thought it would finish higher!  (Oh I see the word dujour: "distracting" lol maybe that''s the reason?  nah)</td>', 'Beautiful photo.  The bubbles give it an extra kick.  I gave it an 8 and thought it would finish higher!  (Oh I see the word dujour: "distracting" lol maybe that''s the reason?  nah)', '2009-02-09 08:15:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246458, 761932, 67697, '<td valign="top">Great SP Jeb!  I think the focus is off a smidge but it didn''t really detract that much from the overall photo.  You look great!  And I thought this should have finished higher too.</td>', 'Great SP Jeb!  I think the focus is off a smidge but it didn''t really detract that much from the overall photo.  You look great!  And I thought this should have finished higher too.', '2009-02-09 08:18:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246465, 761995, 67697, '<td valign="top">Oh well I am sorry I did not comment during the challenge - so let me be the first now!  I gave this a 7. I thought the clarity was excellent and for me, the color met the challenge.  I also thought that the pose was beautiful too.  This should have finished higher!</td>', 'Oh well I am sorry I did not comment during the challenge - so let me be the first now!  I gave this a 7. I thought the clarity was excellent and for me, the color met the challenge.  I also thought that the pose was beautiful too.  This should have finished higher!', '2009-02-09 08:19:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246467, 761486, 81530, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your top 10 finish.</td>', 'Congrats on your top 10 finish.', '2009-02-09 08:21:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246468, 761927, 67697, '<td valign="top">Well I thought this was gray!  I love how you filled the frame with all kitty.  Should have finished higher.</td>', 'Well I thought this was gray!  I love how you filled the frame with all kitty.  Should have finished higher.', '2009-02-09 08:22:55.000000', NULL, 0),
