(5246489, 760880, 67697, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the ribbon Roz! This was one I really liked.  It''s such a beautiful capture!<br/> <br/>And stay safe woman.  You and your countrymen are in my thoughts and prayers.</td>', 'Congratulations on the ribbon Roz! This was one I really liked.  It''s such a beautiful capture! And stay safe woman.  You and your countrymen are in my thoughts and prayers.', '2009-02-09 08:37:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246498, 759871, 58457, '<td valign="top">I think your inclusion of the black border really shows that you don''t have that much black in the actual image.<br/> <br/>Also, its impressive that you still have a image with contrast despite the lack of extremes.</td>', 'I think your inclusion of the black border really shows that you don''t have that much black in the actual image. Also, its impressive that you still have a image with contrast despite the lack of extremes.', '2009-02-09 08:44:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246626, 760880, 66193, '<td valign="top">Roz,  I knew this one would do well.  In fact, I''m surprised that it isn''t even higher.  This is just a fantastic image!  congrats!</td>', 'Roz,  I knew this one would do well.  In fact, I''m surprised that it isn''t even higher.  This is just a fantastic image!  congrats!', '2009-02-09 09:39:17.000000', NULL, 0),
