(5246804, 761928, 86447, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Grey for the Blue!  Congrats!</td>', 'Beautiful Grey for the Blue!  Congrats!', '2009-02-09 11:07:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246814, 761947, 86447, '<td valign="top">This is underrated, IMHO.    Lovely.</td>', 'This is underrated, IMHO.    Lovely.', '2009-02-09 11:11:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246815, 760880, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmygosh, Roz!  Those voters are in fact, unpredictable, but THIS photo was a no-brainer for ANY crowd!  :)  It and you are so amazing.   I''m so happy for your win of another ribbon.   <br/> <br/>I''ve been hearing about the brush fires in Victoria on the news.  I have been saying prayers for them, hoping none of our dpc family is right in the midst of it.   Thank you for the update, the news didn''t personalize it by saying that so many have lost their lives, and of course the countless people whose lives will never be the same because they have lost everything.   Keep us posted, okay?<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ohmygosh, Roz!  Those voters are in fact, unpredictable, but THIS photo was a no-brainer for ANY crowd!  :)  It and you are so amazing.   I''m so happy for your win of another ribbon.    I''ve been hearing about the brush fires in Victoria on the news.  I have been saying prayers for them, hoping none of our dpc family is right in the midst of it.   Thank you for the update, the news didn''t personalize it by saying that so many have lost their lives, and of course the countless people whose lives will never be the same because they have lost everything.   Keep us posted, okay? ', '2009-02-09 11:11:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246819, 759871, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is so stunning!  It''s sad all 5 winners couldn''t be winners this time.  The top 5 photos are definitely worthy of top awards.  Congratulations!<br/> <br/></td>', 'This is so stunning!  It''s sad all 5 winners couldn''t be winners this time.  The top 5 photos are definitely worthy of top awards.  Congratulations! ', '2009-02-09 11:12:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246828, 761815, 24454, '<td valign="top">ALWAYS a favorite subject of mine.  Jeeez, I wish this crowd appreciated the beauty and penetrating soul of these amazing animals more.  Especially when photographed so brilliantly like this.  To me, this is worthy of a ribbon and an off-the-chart score, but I''ve noticed these animals always get lower than they deserve :(   But what a beautiful portfolio addition for you :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'ALWAYS a favorite subject of mine.  Jeeez, I wish this crowd appreciated the beauty and penetrating soul of these amazing animals more.  Especially when photographed so brilliantly like this.  To me, this is worthy of a ribbon and an off-the-chart score, but I''ve noticed these animals always get lower than they deserve :(   But what a beautiful portfolio addition for you :) ', '2009-02-09 11:16:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246830, 761826, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oooooh. .. I love it!  Having just photographed a rhino, I am so appreciative of how rare it is for the rhino to even look up from its grass-eating to pose :)  When they do, they certainly make a stunning portrait, don''t they :)   You nailed it!   Congratulations!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oooooh. .. I love it!  Having just photographed a rhino, I am so appreciative of how rare it is for the rhino to even look up from its grass-eating to pose :)  When they do, they certainly make a stunning portrait, don''t they :)   You nailed it!   Congratulations! ', '2009-02-09 11:17:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246835, 761556, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwww, GREG!  This is so awesome!   We don''t have Kaula bears over here, so they are revered like living teddy bears :)   Great job!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Awwwww, GREG!  This is so awesome!   We don''t have Kaula bears over here, so they are revered like living teddy bears :)   Great job! ', '2009-02-09 11:18:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246844, 761490, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwwww, he is so precious, and if it were me rating this challenge, this one would be in the top VERY few!   It doesn''t get much better than this!   I hope you have many years of enjoying little Bubba.</td>', 'Awwwwww, he is so precious, and if it were me rating this challenge, this one would be in the top VERY few!   It doesn''t get much better than this!   I hope you have many years of enjoying little Bubba.', '2009-02-09 11:20:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246851, 761947, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is AMAZING!  What a brilliant, creative shot.  I am so disappointed in these un-artistic voters who didn''t give this the score it deserves!   But I''m betting your clients absolutely loves it -- and hopefully will pay big bucks for it!   For sure it will be treasured long after the ridiculously low 5.7 score is forgotten!<br/> <br/></td>', 'This is AMAZING!  What a brilliant, creative shot.  I am so disappointed in these un-artistic voters who didn''t give this the score it deserves!   But I''m betting your clients absolutely loves it -- and hopefully will pay big bucks for it!   For sure it will be treasured long after the ridiculously low 5.7 score is forgotten! ', '2009-02-09 11:22:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246875, 761937, 11854, '<td valign="top">Beat me by 0.0952 this time! I swear I''m going to get you one of these days! ROFL!</td>', 'Beat me by 0.0952 this time! I swear I''m going to get you one of these days! ROFL!', '2009-02-09 11:31:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246902, 761882, 74534, '<td valign="top">Here''s the person who gave you the 10 checking in :) I thought this was a great picture, in my opinion the best in the challenge. I loved the looming mountain in the back, the foreground-background ratio achieved through the long focal length, and the menacing feeling that goes well with the challenge theme. The mountain in the back is hiding, waiting to be discovered as one explores the image. However, I believe this was also what doomed the photo here - if one spends 0.3 seconds before voting, they don''t see all there is to this image, which I suspect is the reason for all the 6''s. Great pic.</td>', 'Here''s the person who gave you the 10 checking in :) I thought this was a great picture, in my opinion the best in the challenge. I loved the looming mountain in the back, the foreground-background ratio achieved through the long focal length, and the menacing feeling that goes well with the challenge theme. The mountain in the back is hiding, waiting to be discovered as one explores the image. However, I believe this was also what doomed the photo here - if one spends 0.3 seconds before voting, they don''t see all there is to this image, which I suspect is the reason for all the 6''s. Great pic.', '2009-02-09 11:45:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246907, 762016, 74534, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured the essence of the moment, the feeling of the event and the state of mind, which is so much harder than capturing some tiny spec of a pencil tip in great sharp detail. And on top of that, goes so well with the theme - the gray actually adds to the image. One of my favs in the challenge, and a 10 from me.</td>', 'You''ve captured the essence of the moment, the feeling of the event and the state of mind, which is so much harder than capturing some tiny spec of a pencil tip in great sharp detail. And on top of that, goes so well with the theme - the gray actually adds to the image. One of my favs in the challenge, and a 10 from me.', '2009-02-09 11:48:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246981, 762042, 100831, '<td valign="top">Like I said, I really like your photo. The hint of the house on the hill is special. You live in a very pretty place!<br/>Anyway, it was worth the comment and I don''t understand why others chose not to.</td>', 'Like I said, I really like your photo. The hint of the house on the hill is special. You live in a very pretty place!Anyway, it was worth the comment and I don''t understand why others chose not to.', '2009-02-09 12:31:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246985, 760631, 100831, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 6 for being not quite "on topic" but, like I said - I think its clever and adorable! Congrats on your ribbon(?).</td>', 'I gave it a 6 for being not quite "on topic" but, like I said - I think its clever and adorable! Congrats on your ribbon(?).', '2009-02-09 12:34:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246990, 761928, 100831, '<td valign="top">Congrats!!! I love this - she is so beautiful.<br/>Now we need a happy challenge so we can see her smile!</td>', 'Congrats!!! I love this - she is so beautiful.Now we need a happy challenge so we can see her smile!', '2009-02-09 12:37:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246991, 761854, 33535, '<td valign="top">wow dude this is really cool and way underrated imo!<br/>the artificial tear adds so much, would have been really cliche if you had tried to make it look "real" but this way it''s nicely dark and eerie...<br/>good to see you back my friend!</td>', 'wow dude this is really cool and way underrated imo!the artificial tear adds so much, would have been really cliche if you had tried to make it look "real" but this way it''s nicely dark and eerie...good to see you back my friend!', '2009-02-09 12:38:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5246993, 760137, 100831, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. Congratulations on your ribbon!</td>', 'Very nicely done. Congratulations on your ribbon!', '2009-02-09 12:39:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5247003, 760880, 100831, '<td valign="top">I love your story about the photo and how it came about. <br/>Congratulations on the red ribbon!! <br/>... I will keep you (plural)in my thoughts and prayers as this trajedy continues in your beautiful country. Stay safe.</td>', 'I love your story about the photo and how it came about. Congratulations on the red ribbon!! ... I will keep you (plural)in my thoughts and prayers as this trajedy continues in your beautiful country. Stay safe.', '2009-02-09 12:45:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5247024, 760137, 66515, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what it is with pencils but they always seem to have appeal. Especially when they are well captured like this scene is. Well done and congrats!</td>', 'I don''t know what it is with pencils but they always seem to have appeal. Especially when they are well captured like this scene is. Well done and congrats!', '2009-02-09 13:03:16.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5247037, 760880, 30214, '<td valign="top">Roz, congrats on a fine image and a ribbon! btw, the cobweb itself works like some sort of a creepy sun :).</td>', 'Roz, congrats on a fine image and a ribbon! btw, the cobweb itself works like some sort of a creepy sun :).', '2009-02-09 13:16:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5247054, 761928, 75585, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image - congrats on your first blue!!  You are going to do very well here!!  I can''t wait to see what you have in store.</td>', 'Beautiful image - congrats on your first blue!!  You are going to do very well here!!  I can''t wait to see what you have in store.', '2009-02-09 13:27:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5247055, 761928, 46177, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your blue with this wonderful portrait!</td>', 'Congratulations on your blue with this wonderful portrait!', '2009-02-09 13:28:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5247056, 761196, 50641, '<td valign="top">This was my high scorer for the grey challenge  - very interesting comp and catch.  I like your crop - I guess the only thing I wonder, as far as DPC values go, is whether the blue sky could have been brought out in a way that would contrast the birds more.  Great shapes and expressions - I think there must be an ancient Asian fairy tale about this picture somewhere.  Sorry about the undeserved score.</td>', 'This was my high scorer for the grey challenge  - very interesting comp and catch.  I like your crop - I guess the only thing I wonder, as far as DPC values go, is whether the blue sky could have been brought out in a way that would contrast the birds more.  Great shapes and expressions - I think there must be an ancient Asian fairy tale about this picture somewhere.  Sorry about the undeserved score.', '2009-02-09 13:29:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5247061, 760880, 46177, '<td valign="top">Wow Roz, this is really lovely, congratulations on your ribbon!  2 so far this year you are really off to a great start.</td>', 'Wow Roz, this is really lovely, congratulations on your ribbon!  2 so far this year you are really off to a great start.', '2009-02-09 13:32:05.000000', NULL, 0),
