(5247327, 761928, 60495, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by rmedavid:</b></div><hr/><i> I am trying to figure this out. I took this image FOR the challenge, so why is it disqualified for dating? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Sorry to hear about the DQ, it really hurts especially when you know it was taken for the challenge. My only 7.0 image was DQ''d for a wrong date so I know how it feels, I actually set the year wrong when I was checkeing to make sure I had the time set right....I can laugh now but it really hurt when it happened. Still a beautiful image!</td>', 'Originally posted by rmedavid: I am trying to figure this out. I took this image FOR the challenge, so why is it disqualified for dating?   Sorry to hear about the DQ, it really hurts especially when you know it was taken for the challenge. My only 7.0 image was DQ''d for a wrong date so I know how it feels, I actually set the year wrong when I was checkeing to make sure I had the time set right....I can laugh now but it really hurt when it happened. Still a beautiful image!', '2009-02-09 15:40:11.000000', NULL, 0),
